{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"TIT","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"提多书","commonName":"提多书","title":"提多书","order":56,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"df519a01846b1c55f438a1b8917fff8825afa6339ebe49bdba4ca0ed1d15b991","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/TIT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/TIT/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":46},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["热心行善"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你要提醒众人，叫他们顺服作官的、掌权的，遵他的命，预备行各样的善事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["不要毁谤，不要争竞，总要和平，向众人大显温柔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我们从前也是无知、悖逆、受迷惑、服事各样私欲，和宴乐，常存恶毒",{"noteId":1},"嫉妒的心，是可恨的，又是彼此相恨。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但到了 神—我们救主的恩慈和他向人所施的慈爱显明的时候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他便救了我们；并不是因我们自己所行的义，乃是照他的怜悯，借着重生的洗和圣灵的更新。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["圣灵就是 神借着耶稣基督—我们救主厚厚浇灌在我们身上的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["好叫我们因他的恩得称为义，可以凭着永生的盼望成为后嗣",{"noteId":2},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["这话是可信的。我也愿你把这些事切切实实地讲明，使那些已信 神的人留心做正经事业",{"noteId":3},"。这都是美事，并且与人有益。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["要远避无知的辩论和家谱的空谈，以及纷争，并因律法而起的争竞，因为这都是虚妄无益的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["分门结党的人，警戒过一两次，就要弃绝他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因为知道这等人已经背道，犯了罪，自己明知不是，还是去做。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["个人的指示和问安"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我打发亚提马或是推基古到你那里去的时候，你要赶紧往尼哥坡里去见我，因为我已经定意在那里过冬。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你要赶紧给律师西纳和亚波罗送行，叫他们没有缺乏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["并且我们的人要学习正经事业",{"noteId":4},"，预备所需用的，免得不结果子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["同我在一处的人都问你安。请代问那些因有信心爱我们的人安。愿恩惠常与你们众人同在！"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或译：阴毒","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":3}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或译：可以凭着盼望承受永生","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":7}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"或译：留心行善","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":8}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"或译：要学习行善","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/TIT/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PHM/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/TIT/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}